\label{sec:result_scaling}

Results from GPT2-Medium (355M) confirm that model collapse generalizes to larger models, is substantially amplified, and that data curation provides unexpectedly strong regularization at this scale. Table~\ref{tab:medium_comparison} reports Generation~7 results for three methods (seed=42, $n{=}1$; External-only in progress).%
